# H1 the guards, held over a run longer than fx's ten-second auto-upgrade
# delay: one turn, then idle past 18 s, with the binary's internet sockets
# sampled at launch, during the turn, after 12 s and at the end. The run's
# `guards:` line (fx) says the binary's sha256 and the chime directories held;
# the gateway log is every request the binary made of it; a `sockets` file is
# every socket the binary had open at that moment, all of them loopback, or
# the run would have failed.
gateway h1-guards-turns.json
wait 2
sockets launch
type say something slowly
key Enter
wait 0.5
sockets turn
wait 10
sockets t12
snap mid
wait 6
sockets end
snap end
home end
gwlog
